9-4027-a784-37deef9a439a" class="r-4vjjqd" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="a09b40c0-719a-4ec2-9430-d32b8bf02405" class="r-udq7mw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>30-day Money Back Guarantee</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="a395a779-28d2-470e-ab81-0c1c57ed643d" class="r-1v8adlu" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f355c21a-eb43-4cdd-935c-6b979acfa428" class="r-186d1uc" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3b05e6ae-e9da-4833-a0cb-1b5382f526db" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3jlfb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1f55kx8"><div data-rid="501eff7e-df6e-4f70-916f-eb7f7485ff9f" class="r-1yq9m2o alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why Boostcous?</p></span></div><div data-rid="9f9babab-6839-4458-8e97-29c21438f927" class="r-1my6teg" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3jlfb2:"><div data-rid="39775974-ea45-41c0-90e8-fd25a3b83f61" class="r-p1wmic"><div data-rid="28e7690d-85e8-4be9-9c4d-054d8e607b7c" class="r-y7lvn6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Because your carbs should pull their weight!</p><p><br></p><p>Traditional grains fall short on protein. Boostcous is different. A light, fluffy couscous with <strong>complete plant-based protein</strong> and <strong>clean ingredients</strong>. It’s a smarter staple that keeps you full, supports recovery, and powers busy days. From post-workout bowls to weeknight dinners, Boostcous makes eating well effortless.</p><p><br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="8cffe429-6cb5-4567-bf4d-d8ccc478c6df" class="r-1pnzddg" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="38412b3b-c490-4747-8fea-d4a418e02711" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5jlfb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1stn8vx"><div data-rid="e129e2db-f487-466d-b543-af4817b4b81c" class="r-b82r4e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ingredients</p></span></div><div data-rid="1caaa4ac-5e1c-4ce2-a2ea-b73aa190514a" class="r-keq2wf" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5jlfb2:"><div data-rid="f8cf7799-9781-4644-bbe9-39e7aeb1d56e" class="r-vyo7lb"><div data-rid="53030e4a-12bc-4336-9674-b3763eb4b992" class="r-p7rdd6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Boostcous is made with 3 simple non-GMO and Glyphosate free ingredients.</p><br><p>Chickpea flour, Lentil flour and Pea flour. All ingredients have been tested for Glyphosate by 3rd party testing facilities and have been found to be Glyphosate free. You can see the test <a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0814/9601/5123/files/SimpleLab_Report_FMY67B.pdf?v=1772901079"><u>here</u></a> </p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f44e0039-ac96-45e5-81e9-a596c19d6448" class="r-14f4hk4" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="54586ce3-2890-4fc6-bb0f-657d9b9c74ab" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7jlfb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-72947c"><div data-rid="01ebfd16-b8a2-4776-aed3-2a845d9fa9f4" class="r-56yijm alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Directions</p></span></div><div data-rid="89330eda-fd03-4c61-b37f-78c6f957ff3a" class="r-jdt2qq" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7jlfb2:"><div data-rid="a91a21ea-4ddf-4bda-8b78-2ade668c2a0a" class="r-1iuxww1"><div data-rid="4bfe030e-ec99-4a8e-ab72-cd6e0c9377ec" class="r-k3ivr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><ol><li><p>Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil.</p></li><li><p>Add 1 box of Boostcous and stir well. Some foaming is normal.<br></p></li><li><p>Reduce to simmer and cook for 5-7 minutes depending on your desired firmness.</p></li><li><p>Strain well, rinse with warm water and serve with your favorite dish! Enjoy!</p></li></ol><p><br></p><p>Boostcous cooks in anywhere from 5-7 minutes. Make sure you boil in generously salted water, and do not overcook!&nbsp; Please experiment with cooking times to find the right cooking time for you and your family. It's important to rinse the Couscous after draining the water and to make sure to not overcook the Couscous</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="74658716-8b61-4701-9331-e59658061081" class="r-tosjc8" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="a8ed0